  _headline: "Agente de sa\xFAde bate na porta e o posto vem junto"
  _headlineEn: Health agent knocks, and the clinic comes along
  _body: "Vizinhos treinados acompanham gestantes, crian\xE7as e idosos casa a casa.
    Seu Arnaldo mediu a press\xE3o e agora dirige mais devagar."
  _bodyEn: Trained neighbors check on pregnant women, children and the elderly door
    to door. Arnaldo had his blood pressure taken and now drives slower.
